> 1) What, in your opinion would be the best artifact weapon to use with the
> Valkyrie.  In my present game I  used a wish to obtain Gauntlets of power,
> so my Str is now 25. I have also offered sacrifices to my god Odin and have
> obtained the WarHammer Mjolnir.  Is this in fact the best thing for my
> Valkyrie to do? Are the better and more powerful options for her?

The Mjollnir is a good, ascendable weapon. You will have some trouble 
with shock-resistant monsters; these are common toward the end, 
especially at the very end, but won't be such a problem if you are 
dual-wielding the hammer with something else to boost your damage. If 
both of your weapons are properly enchanted, you will be able to deal 
quite a lot of damage.

> 2) I have searched and searched and I cannot find any Guide created
