I guess that's mostly because there's really nothing special about them. 
They are plain, powerful, "combat-wombats". If you read the relevant 
parts of the artifact spoiler, you'd have most of the specific info.

 > Would be even better if that guide was for Nethack version 3.4.3.

The rightmost number in NetHack versions seems to be the one tracking 
bugfix releases. You can use anything that's 3.4.x for most purposes of 
gameplay spoilage (with minor exceptions).

